<title>USA: Cryenco names Rodney Moe COO.</title>
<headline>Cryenco names Rodney Moe COO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cryenco Sciences Inc Thursday said Rodney Moe, most recently a vice president and head of operations for its West Plant, was named executive vice president and chief operating officer of Cryenco.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman said Dale Brubaker had been chief operating officer and resigned the position about six months ago for personal reasons.</p>
